      "schema:name": "The consulted source reports that the Isle of Milo was used for commerce and fortified.",
      "properties": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED",
        "historically_verified": false
      },
      "historically_verified": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:nabou:cite_f3fe7f1edcd41b00f3db5aea",
      "@type": "Citation",
      "schema:name": "{\"end_char\": 898, \"end_line\": 34, \"original_inspected\": false, \"pdf_file\": null, \"printed_page\": null, \"scan_indexes_0_based\": [140], \"source_file\": \"064d010d9829b25551145b46.txt\", \"start_char\": 147, \"start_line\": 15, \"url\": \"https://api.digitale-sammlungen.de/iiif/image/v2/bsb10447069_00141/full/full/0/default.jpg\"}",
      "properties": {
        "source_id": "src_c2b4aebef60d5e1e4f93f19c99378258",
        "locator": "{\"end_char\": 898, \"end_line\": 34, \"original_inspected\": false, \"pdf_file\": null, \"printed_page\": null, \"scan_indexes_0_based\": [140], \"source_file\": \"064d010d9829b25551145b46.txt\", \"start_char\": 147, \"start_line\": 15, \"url\": \"https://api.digitale-sammlungen.de/iiif/image/v2/bsb10447069_00141/full/full/0/default.jpg\"}",
        "exact_excerpt": " Le\nPrince Marc de fon côté s'occupoir à\nl’embellifement & à la fareté de fon\nHle de Milo ; il y attira prefque tout\nle commerce ; par la fuppreflion des\ndroits d’entrées pour tous les vaifleaux\nétrangers cor iendroient y trafiquer,\n& fic conftruîte plufieurs fortereffes\ndans Jes lieux où les defcentes étoient\na craindre.",
        "attribution": "stated"
      },
      "historically_verified": false
    },
